es were converted into ordinary shares.","section":"ITEM 19.EXHIBITS","block":2084,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-057895","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-05-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026057895/ea0287322-20f_yimutian.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b7d35677ef84f8e9cc7d65ab5dfac43fd7f75f3ed0858b608d21969689a73941.bin","sha256":"b7d35677ef84f8e9cc7d65ab5dfac43fd7f75f3ed0858b608d21969689a73941"}},{"id":"1cd99e388e928d23a5b9f291464cd8e626e0682b632d6d8e6769e7f83b969bff","quote":"The principal of Series C ODI Convertible Loan issued by the Company’s onshore entity was RMB42,055 (Note 11). Upon the investor’s exercise of the warrant and the Company issued preferred shares to the investor, the Company’s onshore entity partially repaid Series C ODI Convertible loan of RMB27,027 and entered into a new interest free shareholder loan agreement with the investor in the amount of RMB15,028, which is due on demand. In 2023 and 2024, the Company’s onshore entity repaid RMB2,000 and RMB500 to the investor, respectively. The Company completed its IPO on August 19, 2025, and the preferred shares were converted into ordinary shares.","context":"The Group borrowed interest free loans from its Founder and certain investors.","section":"ITEM 19.EXHIBITS","block":2094,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-057895","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-05-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026057895/ea0287322-20f_yimutian.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b7d35677ef84f8e9cc7d65ab5dfac43fd7f75f3ed0858b608d21969689a73941.bin","sha256":"b7d35677ef84f8e9cc7d65ab5dfac43fd7f75f3ed0858b608d21969689a73941"}},{"id":"409573aa1f4e93aafb6653de2fb4bb30a3